text.en:
Use variables (`idx`, `found`, `next_g`) and let the 2-bit `unsigned` index wrap on its own.
```vhdl
idx := last + 1; found := false; next_g := (others => '0');
for i in 0 to 3 loop
    if not found then
        if req(to_integer(idx)) = '1' then
            next_g(to_integer(idx)) := '1'; last <= idx; found := true;
        end if;
        idx := idx + 1;
    end if;
end loop;
g <= next_g;
```

